{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Screen Stitcher 可將重疊的截圖拼接成單一長圖，適合整理對話、文章、操作步驟與其他滾動內容，方便閱讀及分享。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-183.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自動拼接與精細調整</h2>\n<p>可從相片或檔案匯入截圖，排序後自動拼接，系統會對齊重疊內容，移除重複部分及接縫控制項。每處接合可預覽並逐像素微調；亦可重新排序、裁剪上下多餘區域，再用色塊遮蓋敏感資料。可縮放檢查，匯出 PNG、JPEG 或分頁 PDF，項目保存在本機。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-146-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-147-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-148-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-149-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-150-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-151-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Screen Stitcher</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/screen-stitcher/id1288339604?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:19:14.985846+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:07:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:41:17.150355+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:12:22.876564+00:00","content_hash":"1b5c99c2e69fd5c215fbd1d7b1e875375fad9a3c2a1b4965fe3472085d3648b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}